>>
Rule 1 (input must be a 4-D tensor)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 4
>>
Rule 2 (crops must be a 2×2 matrix with non-negative entries)
{v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_2) = 2 ∧ shape(v_2, 0) = 2 ∧ shape(v_2, 1) = 2 ∧ min(v_2) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 3 (block_size must be at least 2)
{v_3 : int} |= v_3 ≥ 2
>>
Rule 4 (batch dimension must be divisible by block_size squared)
{v_1 : tensor, v_3 : int} |= ndim(v_1) = 4 ∧ v_3 ≥ 2 ∧ shape(v_1, 0) % (v_3 * v_3) = 0
>>
Rule 5 (post-crop spatial dimensions must be strictly positive)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor, v_3 : int} |= ndim(v_1) = 4 ∧ ndim(v_2) = 2 ∧ shape(v_2, 0) = 2 ∧ shape(v_2, 1) = 2 ∧ v_3 ≥ 2 ∧ shape(v_1, 1) * v_3 > 2 * max(v_2) ∧ shape(v_1, 2) * v_3 > 2 * max(v_2)
>>
Rule 6 (dtype well-formedness for input tensor)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = dtype_(v_1)
